  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">02</span>Inbuilt now vs still-SQL</h2>
    <p class="sub">#516 promoted unpivot/lookup/json_encode; <strong>#530 added <code>tree_flatten</code></strong> for recursive report-trees. Exactly one relational reshape now falls to the DuckDB SQL transform:</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h3><span class="tag done">now inbuilt · #516</span> Wide → long unpivot</h3><ul>
        <li><b>deel</b> — gross-to-net dynamic column map → tall rows</li>
        <li><b>sharepoint / onedrive</b> — timeseries period-header sheet → long</li>
        <li><b>personio / attio</b> — attribute / value-map → one row per key</li>
      </ul></div>
      <div class="card"><h3><span class="tag done">now inbuilt · #516</span> Reference-table lookup</h3><ul>
        <li><b>hibob</b> — named-list ID → human-readable label</li>
