199	      <p>The remaining <strong>5 Partials</strong> are all per-connector vendor specifics, not missing framework primitives: shopify (GraphQL nested-connection paging + ShopifyQL), stripe (vendor SDK + events model), plaid (<code>/transactions/sync</code> + soft-delete), sage (proprietary XML gateway), syteline (report stored-procs).</p>
